{"hymn":"FR33","parent":"E207","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Quand nous pensons à Toi Seigneur","subtitle":"","syl":{"n1":"Quand","n2":"nous","n3":["pen","i"],"n5":["sons","t"],"n7":"à","n9":"Toi","n11":["Sei","i"],"n12":["gneur,","t"],"n13":"À","n14":"Ton","n15":["a","i"],"n16":["mour,","t"],"n19":"Ta","n20":"grâce,","n21":"Le","n22":["dé","i"],"n23":["sir","t"],"n24":"brule","n25":"en","n26":["no","i"],"n28":["tre","t"],"n29":"cœur","n30":"De","n32":"Te","n33":"voir","n34":"face","n36":"à","n37":"face."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Quoique parfois lassés, chargés,","Les Tiens, ici, cheminent","En un lieu sec et désolé,","Où ne croit que l'épine."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Satisfaits pourtant, chaque jour,","S'attachant à Ta trace.","Ils peuvent chanter Ton amour","Et célébrer Ta grâce."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Toi, notre refuge et rocher,","Repos, salut, justice ;","De Toi, Seigneur, nous approcher,","Fait tout notre délice."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Sauveur béni qui nous soutient,","Tu fortifies Tes saints,","Jusqu'au jour où tous Tes vainqueurs,","Contempleront Ta gloire."]}]}